A package whose every file is behind a build tag. Shaped after delegator/web, where
web_acceptance_test.go carries //go:build acceptance and is the only .go file in the directory.

Such a directory is not a package. `go list ./...` does not match it, and -e does not rescue it —
there is nothing to report an error about. So the numbers below are the ones you get by default,
and the acceptance suite is missing from all of them.

TestScanUsesBuildTags scans this same archive with the tag and finds the other package.

